1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,145
Quick recap.

2
00:00:01,145 --> 00:00:07,864
Birth and death rates are per thousand people, but infant mortality is per thousand live births.

3
00:00:07,864 --> 00:00:14,088
Doubling time is about seventy over the growth rate: seventy five years for Nepal today.

4
00:00:14,088 --> 00:00:19,244
Pyramids show growth, and Nepal is late in the demographic transition.

5
00:00:19,244 --> 00:00:23,164
In malaria, the mosquito is the definitive host.

6
00:00:23,164 --> 00:00:26,041
H I V destroys helper T cells.

7
00:00:26,041 --> 00:00:30,156
And non communicable diseases now cause most deaths.

